This discussion about pets brings up something that I found really annoying-

When you are not wearing a blindfold, and you try to move onto the space
that your pet occupies (to get your pet to move), the game's response is 
'You stop to avoid hitting Shithead'.  However, if you are BLIND and you
try the same thing, the response is 'Really attack Shithead? y/n?' and
the pet stays in the same spot if you say 'n' to the question.

I find this somewhat inconsistent, because, when you are not blind, the
game will not let you attack your pet.  However when blind, the game
KNOWS that it is your pet (it used your pet's name!!!) and if the option
is set correctly (is it the safepet option?) the game should KNOW that you
do not want to attack your pet.

